sections.description:
status: Current detailed flags, location, job targets and needs with mood/health overview. Need levels are not stock quantities. Returns status { downed drafted dead inMentalState mentalState position { x y z mapId } currentJob { id defName report targets(first:3) { items { slot kind thingId mapId x y z } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } } needs(first:20) { items { defName label level maxLevel percentage } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } } mood { level } health { summary { healthPercent pain } }
mood: Current/instant mood, game break thresholds and effective thought groups. Raw memories/group members are available through exact queries. Groups use the game's contribution, not a sum of memories. Returns mood { level instant breakThresholds { minor major extreme } thoughtGroups(first:20) { items { defName label stageIndex moodOffset memberCount } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } }
health: Health summary, body capacities and UI-visible conditions with body-part references and optional tending/immunity. Conditions include implants, not only wounds. Full body tree via exact query. Returns health { summary { healthPercent pain bleedRate downed inPainShock } capacities(first:20) { items { defName label level } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } conditions(first:20) { items { id defName label severity severityLabel visible part { key defName label index parentKey } tending { isTended quality ticksLeft } immunity { level fullyImmune } } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } }
equipment: Equipped weapons, worn apparel and carried inventory, with item identity and basic item properties. Quality null means not applicable. Returns equipment { Primary { id } AllEquipmentListForReading(first:5) { items { id runtimeType def { defName label category thingClass } stackCount Stuff { defName } HitPoints MaxHitPoints } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } } apparel { WornApparel(first:10) { items { id runtimeType def { defName label category thingClass } stackCount Stuff { defName } HitPoints MaxHitPoints } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } } inventory { innerContainer { items(first:10) { items { id runtimeType def { defName label category thingClass } stackCount Stuff { defName } HitPoints MaxHitPoints } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } } } carryTracker { CarriedThing { id runtimeType def { defName label category thingClass } stackCount Stuff { defName } HitPoints MaxHitPoints } }
profile: Age, background, traits including suppression, and learned skills. Calculated stats are separate: discover statDefinitions then request stats(defNames). Returns profile { gender raceDefName kindDefName age { biologicalYears chronologicalYears lifeStage } backstories(first:2) { items { slot defName title description } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } traits(first:20) { items { defName label description degree suppressed sourceGeneDefName suppressedByGeneDefName } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } skills(first:32) { items { defName label level passion aptitude totallyDisabled permanentlyDisabled } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } }

basic: Native Thing identity, def reference, stackCount, Stuff and HP; not a flattened Item DTO. Returns id runtimeType def { defName label category thingClass } stackCount Stuff { defName } HitPoints MaxHitPoints
placement: Native Spawned/Map/MapHeld/Position/PositionHeld and holder references. Storage position is not container ownership. Returns Spawned Map { id } MapHeld { id } Position { x y z } PositionHeld { x y z } holdingOwner { Owner { ref runtimeType thingId } } ParentHolder { ref runtimeType thingId }
components: Actual component instances, runtime type and supported native base members. Unknown components remain visible as unsupported metadata. Returns AllComps(first:10) { items { ref runtimeType supported supportedType ... on CompQuality { Quality } ... on CompRottable { RotProgress Stage TicksUntilRotAtCurrentTemp } ... on CompForbiddable { Forbidden } ... on CompIngredients { ingredients(first:10) { items { defName label } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } } } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete }
contents: Direct IThingHolder contents and special MinifiedThing/Corpse references; no recursive full expansion. Returns InnerThing { id runtimeType def { defName } } InnerPawn { id runtimeType } GetDirectlyHeldThings { Owner { ref runtimeType } items(first:10) { items { id runtimeType def { defName label category thingClass } stackCount Stuff { defName } HitPoints MaxHitPoints } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } }

basic: Spawned map things from a native query group, optional definitions/name and cursor. Excludes held contents. No promise of current pawn-specific hauling eligibility. Returns nodes { id runtimeType def { defName label category thingClass } stackCount Stuff { defName } HitPoints MaxHitPoints } pageInfo { hasNextPage endCursor }
placement: Map thing placement and holder references, with per-page continuation. Returns nodes { id Spawned Map { id } MapHeld { id } Position { x y z } PositionHeld { x y z } holdingOwner { Owner { ref runtimeType thingId } } ParentHolder { ref runtimeType thingId } } pageInfo { hasNextPage endCursor }
components: Bounded component data for the selected page; narrow first for expensive combinations. Returns nodes { id AllComps(first:10) { items { ref runtimeType supported supportedType ... on CompQuality { Quality } ... on CompRottable { RotProgress Stage TicksUntilRotAtCurrentTemp } ... on CompForbiddable { Forbidden } ... on CompIngredients { ingredients(first:10) { items { defName label } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } } } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } } pageInfo { hasNextPage endCursor }

basic: Native ThingDef identity, runtime class, category and stack limit. Returns defName label thingClass category stackLimit
hauling: Definition-level native hauling properties, not current pawn eligibility. Returns defName alwaysHaulable designateHaulable EverHaulable CountAsResource
ingestible: Native ingestible definition data; null if absent, not a pawn-specific food permission. Returns defName ingestible { foodType drugCategory HumanEdible IsMeal CachedNutrition maxNumToIngestAtOnce }
component_definitions: Declared CompProperties and content-category references; no reflection of custom members. Returns defName comps(first:20) { items { runtimeType compClass } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete } thingCategories(first:20) { items { defName label parent { defName } } total offset returned hasMore nextOffset complete }

